<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Vakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya pili ya Pauli kwa Vakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Vakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Vako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya pili ya Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vakolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ya pili ya Pauli kwa Vakolinto yayandikwi pagati ya miyaka ya hamsini na mhanu mbaka na sita kuhuma peavelikiwi Yesu Kilisitu (musula ya 1:1). Yeniyi ndi balua ya pili yetivi nayu pagati ya balua zivili Pauli zeavayandikili msambi wa vandu vevakumsadiki Kilisitu va Kolinto kula. Vandu vevasomili visadika kuvya Pauli alongolili kuvayandikila balua yingi yikali. Magono aga tivii nayu lepi balua yeniyo yeajovili (musula ya 2:3-4). Balua yeniyi ya pili kwa Vakolinto yilolekana yayandikiwi na Pauli lukumbi peavili Makedonia (musula ya 2:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua yeniyi ya pili yiwanangana lepi na yingi ndava yilongelela mambu ga mundu mwene na kupamisa mtima. Pauli ihekelela na malovi gabwina gegaletiwi na Tito kuhuma mu msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Kolinto mubalua yeniyi kuvi na mawuliwu ndava kumuwusila luteta Chapanga ngati cheyiganikiwa mu Lilaganu la mupya, ngati cheyilolekana muchifungu chila Pauli ilagazila vandu vawusa mashonga muni gapelekwa kuvatangatila vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Yelusalemu (musula za 8 na 9). Mewawa yilolekana kuvya vamitumi vaudese kuhuma kuvala ya msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vahekalili mhutanu wewavi pagati ya Pauli na vamsadika vangi vamitumi vaudese vala vavi mukujova muni valola mawuliwu gawaka. Vamitumi vaudese vavevisi uhotola wa Pauli, lijambu lelamkitili Pauli akengelela kwa makakala uhotola waki ya kuvya ndi mtumi wa Yesu Kilisitu peamalakisa balua yeniyi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli itumbula balua yaki kwa kuvajambusa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu (musula ya 1:1-7).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Pauli ilongela kunga'namusa mpangu wa lugendu lwaki na malovi geagayuwini kuhuma kwavi na chevamyangwili balua yaki (musula ya 1:8-7:16).</para>
  <para style="io">Pagamaliki ago Pauli ilagazila mpangu wa kupata mashonga gakuvatangatila vamsadika va ku Yelusalemu (musula ya 8:1-9:15).</para>
  <para style="io">Pamwishu Pauli idandaula malovi ga utumi waki na kuvajovela cheakuvagendela kavili (musula ya 10:1-13:10).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Nene Pauli, mtumi wa Kilisitu Yesu kwa kugana kwa Chapanga, pamonga na mlongo witu Timoti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Nikuvayandikila nyenye vandu mwemkumsadika Kilisitu kwenuko ku Kolinto, na vandu voha vma Chapanga vevavi kila pandu pamulima wa Akaya.<verse eid="2CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Tikuvaganila uteke na ubwina kuhuma kwa Chapanga Dadi witu na BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akumsengusa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Chapanga alumbiwa wa BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu, Dadi mweavi na lipyana na Chapanga mweipolesa mitima. <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>Chapanga akutipolesa mitima mang'ahiso gitu goha muni na tete tivapolesa mitima vangi vevana mu mang'ahiso ndalindali, kwa kupoleswa mitima wula wetiupokili kuhuma kwa mwene. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Na chating'aika kupata mang'ahiso ndava ya kumhengela Kilisitu mewawa ndi chetipoleswa neju mitima na Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Ngati tinga'hika, ndi ndava kupoleswa mitima kwinu na kusanguliwa kwinu. Tikapoleswa mitima ndi mewa na nyenye pamupoleswa mitima na kupewa makakala ga kukangamala mang'ahiso galagala. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>Kangi, huvalila yitu ndava yinu gasindimili, timanyili kuvya mwakahanganilayi mumanga'iso gitu, mewawa na nyenye yati mwihanganila kupoleswa mitima kwitu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Valongo, tigana lepi nyenye mkoto kumanya mang'ahiso gegatikolili ku Asia, mang'ahiso genago gatopili neju, kupita uhotola witu wa kukangamala hati huvalila yoha ya kutama yatimaliki. <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Chakaka tete mumitima yitu tajiwene ngati vandu vevahukumiwi kukomewa, muni tiwuliwayi kumhuvalila Chapanga mweakuvayukisa vevafwili, pahala pa kuhuvalila makakala gitu tavete. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>Mwene atisangwili mung'aiso gavaha gala gegaganili kutikoma, na iyendelela kutisangula, tete timvikili huvalila yitu kuvya yati akutisangula kavili. <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>Na mwavene mukutitangatila kwa kutiyupila kwa Chapanga. Kutiyupila kwinu yati muyanguliwa, na Chapanga yati akutimotisa ndi vandu vamahele yati vakumsengusa Chapanga ndava yitu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ing'anamusa lugendu lwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Tete timekela chindu chimonga, mtima witu ukutijovela muuchakaka kuvya titamili pamulima apa na neju pagati yinu, mumtima wa usopi na mukusadikika kwekwihuma kwa Chapanga. Tihengili genago lepi kwa luhala lwa chimundu, nambu kuhuma kuubwina wa Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Tikuvayandikila nyenye mambu gamwihotola kugasoma na kugamanya. Mtima wangu wisadika kuvya yati mwimanya hotohoto, <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>muni mbaka hinu mwimanya padebe. Kangi timanya kuvya mwimanya hotohoto kuvya mu ligono la kuwuya BAMBU witu Yesu yati mwimeka ndava yitu ngati tete yati chetimekela ndava yinu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Navi na uchakaka mulijambu lenilo, ndi napangili kuvagendelela nyenye kumbele, muni mpata mota mala zivili kwa kunilola nene mala zivili. <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>Navi na mpangu kuvedukila kwinu mulugendu lwa kuhamba mulima wa Makedonia na mewa palukumbi lwa kuwuya, muni nipatayi utangatila winu mulugendu lwangu lwa kuhamba ku Yudea. <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Muhololela wuli? Panapangili genago nivii ngati namundu nangali luhala. Wu, muholalela kuvya penipanga mambu gangu nikita ngati vandu va mulima uwu “Veviyidakila goha na kubela goha palukumbi lumonga?” <verse eid="2CO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Nambu Chapanga ndi mchakaka hotohoto, ujumbi witu kwinu lepi lijambu la kujova “Ena” Na bahapo “Lepi.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Muni Yesu Kilisitu, Mwana wa Chapanga, mweakokosiliwi kwinu nyenye na Sila na Timoti, na nene Siliwano, avili lepi mundu wa “Ena” Na kubela “Lepi” Mulukumbi lumonga nambu magono goha ndi Ena ya Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Muni mwene ndi mweitimalisa malaganu goha ga Chapanga. Mewawa mu njila ya Yesu Kilisitu tijova “Ena” Ndava ya kumulumba Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Chapanga ndi mweatihagwili na mweatikangamalisa tete pamonga na nyenye mukuwungana na Kilisitu, <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>Atipeli Mpungu Msopi mumitima yitu muni alangisa tete ndi tavandu va Chapanga na avyai ulangisu wa kulangisa kuvya chakaka.<verse eid="2CO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Chapanga ndi mshuudila wangu, mwene aumanyili mtima wangu! Nawuyili lepi kavili Kolinto, ndava nikotoka kuvavinisa mitima mukuvajovela malovi gakali. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Tihenela lepi makakala ndava ya sadika yinu, nyenye msindimili mukusadika kwinu. Getiganikiwa kuhenga lihengu pamonga ndava ya sangaluka yinu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Hinu, niamwili nikuvagendelela lepi kavili nikotoka kuvavinisa mtima. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Muni nikavavinisa mtima nyenye, hinu yani mweakunipolesa mtima nene? Ndi valavala venivavinisi mtima! <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Ndava yeniyo ndi navayandikili kuvya nibwela lepi kavili kwinu nikotoka kuviniswa mtima na vandu veviganikiwa kunihekesa. Nimanyili uchakaka kuvya nene, nakaheka mwavoha nyenye mewa mwiheka. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Panavayandikili apo kadeni navi ngolongondi mumtima na maholi gamahele, yavi lepi ndava ya kuvavinisa mitima nyenye muni kulangisa kuvya nikuvagana neju.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumlekekesa mweambudili Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Hinu avi mundu mweamvinisi mtima muyaki anivinisi lepi mtima nene, nambu avavinisi mitima mwavoha nyenye, ndi mbwitu kuvya namkali neju. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Kwa mundu mwenuyo uhamula weapewili na vandu vamahele yikumkola. <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>Yeyisigalili ndi mbanga kumlekekesa mundu mwenuyo na kumkangamalisa mtima ndi akotoka kuviniswa neju mtima na kuleka kusadika. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Ndi nikuvayupa mumlangisa kuvya mumganili neju. <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>Naganili kuvayandikila balua yila muni naganili kumanya ngati mwihotola kuyidakila kila lijambu. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Mwakamlekekesa mundu, mewa na nene yati nikumlekekesa mundu mwenuyo. Muni panilekekesa, muchakaka ngati niviii na lilovi la kulekekesa, nilekekesa palongolo ya Kilisitu ndava yinu. <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>Muni tikotoka kumpela Setani njila muni atikongayi, muni tiyimanyili uchenjela waki.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli pamuji wa Tuloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Panahikili kumuji wa Tloa kukokosa Lilovi la Bwina la Kilisitu, nakolili BAMBU anidindulili mlyangu muni nihenga lihengu laki. <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>Nambu nakamuliwi wogohi neju namkolili lepi mlongo witu Tito. Hinu ndi navalagili vandu pala nikahamba Makedonia.<verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uhotola muutangatila wa Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Nambu, tikumsengusa Chapanga ndava kila ligono akutilongosa tivii mu msambi wa kulangisa uhotola witu mukuwungana na Kilisitu. Mwene akutikita tidandasa uchakaka wa Kilisitu ngati unungalila bwina, kila pandu. <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Muni tete unungalila bwina ngati ubani weuwusiwa na Kilisitu palongolo ya Chapanga, wehukuvahikila voha, vevisanguliwa na veviyaga. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Kwa vala veviyaga, unungalila wenuwo ndi lifwa, nambu kwa vala vevisanguliwa unungalila wenuwo ndi wumi. Hinu yani mweihotola kukita lihengu ngati lenilo? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Tete lepi ngati vangi vevigana kupata mashonga mu njila yeniyi, pahali paki tikokosa muuchakaka palongolo ya Chapanga, ngati vandu vevatumwili na Chapanga mukuwungana na Kilisitu.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Vanalihengu va lilaganu la mupya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Wu, titumbula kavili kujilumbalila tavete? Wu, tigana balua ya kutimanyisa, kuhuma kwinu amala kwitu ngati chevavili vandu vangi? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Mwavene nyenye ndi balua yitu yeyiyandikiwi mumitima yitu, kila mundu yimanyikana na yisomwa na vandu voha. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>Chakaka kuvya nyenye ndi balua ya Kilisitu yeyihuma mulihengu litu pagati yinu. Balua yene yiyandikwi lepi, nambu kwa Mpungu Msopi wa Chapanga mweavi mumi, iyandikiwi lepi panani ya chipandi cha liganga chechihongoliwi nambu ayandiki mumitima ya vandu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Tihotola kujova kwa ukekesi chenicho ndava ya huvalila kwa Chapanga ndava ya gala geagahengili Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Lepi kuvya tavete tihotola kukita chochoha kwa makakala gitu vene, nambu uhotola witu woha wihuma kwa Chapanga, <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>Ndava muni Chapanga ndi mwatihotwisi kuvya vanalihengu va lilaganu la mupya, lelivii lepi la Lilaganu leliletiwi na malagizu gegayandikwi, nambu lilaganu la Mpungu Msopi. Muni malagizu gegayandikwi gileta lifwa, nambu Mpungu wa Chapanga wumi.<verse eid="2CO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Malagizu gayandikiwi panani ya hipandi ya maganga vyevihongoliwi. Pamonga na kujova mwishu waki ulongosa mulifwa, ukulu waki wavili ukulu neju hati vandu va Isilaeli nakuhotola kuulola pamihu pa Musa ndava ya kung'asima kwaki. Kavili kung'asima kula kwavili mulukumbi ndu. Hinu malagizu gegaletili lifwa yavi na ukulu neju, <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>wu uhengaji wa Mpungu Msopi yati uvya na ukulu neju? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Yikavya mahengu gegileta uhamula gana ukulu ngati wenuwo, ndi hotohoto lihengu lelileta mambu gakumganisa Chapanga, yati givya na ukulu uvaha neju. <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Chakaka chila chechavili na ukulu kadeni pala chiyagisi ukulu waki ndava ya ukulu uvaha neju wewabwelili hinu. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Muni chila chechavi palukumbi luhupi chavi na ukulu waki, chakaka chila chechisigalila magono goha yati chivya na ukulu uvaha neju.<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Ndava muni tivii na huvalila yitu tete tijova kwa ukekesi uvaha. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Tete tikita lepi ngati Musa ndi agubiki pamihu paki na chitambala muni vandu va ku Isilaeli vakotoka kulola mwishu wa kung'asima kula kwekwajimika. <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Nambu luhala lwavi lwagubikwi. Mbaka lelu pamwisoma Lilaganu la kadeni, chigubiku chila chivili balapala. Chigubiku chenicho yati chiwusiwa ndu mundu mukuwungana na Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Nambu, hati lelu iyi peyisomewa malagizu ga BAMBU geampeli Musa luhala lwavi lugubikwi na chitambala. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Nambu, lukumbi mundu peakumuwuyila BAMBU Yesu, chigubiku chenicho chiwusiwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Hinu “BAMBU” Ndi Mpungu Msopi, na popoha peavili Mpungu wa BAMBU ndi pepavi kulekekeswa. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Hinu, tete tavoha pamihu pitu pangagubikwa, tikuulangisa ukulu wa BAMBU ngati chilolilo, tibadilishwa tiwanangana neju na luhumu lwaki muukulu wamahele neju. Lenilo ndi lihengu la Mpungu wa BAMBU.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvika vindu vya chimpungu muvindu vya ludaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Hinu, Chapanga, kwa lipyana laki atigotolili lihengu lenili ndava iyo nakuvya mumbele. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Tigabelili mambu goha ga soni na gamfiyu. Titama lepi kavili kwa kukonga amala kwa kuliyagisa lilovi la Chapanga, pahali paki ndi tijova uchakaka muni vandu vamanya mumitima yavi tete chetivili palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>Muni, ngati Lilovi la Bwina gatikokosa gafiyiki, gafiyiki ndu kwa vala vevayagili. <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>Venavo vasadiki lepi muni yula Setani mweavi chapanga wa mulima uwu asopili chitita muluhala lwavi vakotoka kulola hotohoto lumuli lwa Lilovi la Bwina ga ukulu wa Kilisitu, mweavi ngati Chapanga cheavili. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Nakujikokosela tavete, ndi tikumkokosa Yesu Kilisitu mwavili BAMBU, tete tavete vanalihengu vinu ndava ya Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>Chapanga mwajovili kuvya “Lumuli ndi lulangasayi kuhuma kuchitita,” Chapanga ndi mwakuyilangasa mitima yitu, na kutihotosa kuumanya ukulu wa Chapanga weulangasa pamihu pa Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Hinu, kwa tete tivii ngati vindu vya ludaka mugati yaki vivikiwi vindu vya chimpungu vandu valola hotohoto kuvya makakala genago gakulu gihuma kwa Chapanga nambu lepi kuhuma kwa tete tavete. <verse eid="2CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Magono goha ting'ahiswa, nambu nakusanguliwa, tivya mukuyogopa, nambu nakuvya mumbele, <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>Ting'ahiswa nambu nakutileka changali kutangatilwa. Pamonga na kugwiswa pahi nakukomewa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Lukumbi lwoha tigenda na lifwa la Kilisitu muhiga yitu, muni wumi waki Yesu ndi ulolekana muhiga yitu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Ena, lukumbi lwatitama titindilwa na lifwa magono goha, ndava ya Yesu, muni wumi waki Yesu ulolekana muhiga yitu yeyifwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Ndava yeniyo tete tivii tayali hata kufwa muni nyenye mpata wumi.<verse eid="2CO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, “Nasadiki, ndi mana najovili.” Na tete mewa petivya na mtima wuwowo wa sadika, tisadiki ndava yeniyo tijova. <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>Timanyili kuvya Chapanga mweamyukisi BAMBU Yesu yati akutiyukisa tete mewa pamonga na Yesu kutivika palongolo yaki pamonga na nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>Goha genago ndava yinu, hati ubwina wa Chapanga pauvahikila vandu vamahele neju, usengusa wene wayonjokisiki neju, na kumpela Chapanga ukulu.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutama mukusadika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Ndava yeniyo nakuvya mumbele, hati ngati higa yitu yilalile, nambu mugati mwitu mipungu yitu tikitiwa vamupya ligono kwa ligono. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Mang'ahiso gegakutikolela ndi gadebe, kavili galukumbi ndu, nambu yati gakutipela ukulu mvaha neju wa magono goha kuliku mang'ahiso aga. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Hinu tilola lepi vindu vyevilolekana, nambu tilola vindu vyangalolekana vya lukumbi ndu, nambu vila vyangalolekana ndi vya magono goha.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Muni timanyili kuvya lindanda lenili letitama hinu pamulima apa ndi higa yitu palitupuliwa, Chapanga yati akutipela pandu pangi kunani kwa Chapanga, nyumba ya magono goha yangajengwa kwa mawoko ga vandu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Na hinu, tityalatyala, mukulindila kwa mnogo uvaha kupewa higa ya mupya kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>Ena, ndava ya kupewa higa zenizo muni tilolekana lepi kuvya tivii na higa palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Takavya takona muhiga yeniyi ya chimundu tivemba kwa kukeka. Lepi tigana kuileka higa iyi ya lifwa, nambu tinogela kupewa higa yila ya kunani kwa Chapanga yangafwa, muni kila chechifwa tibadilishwa na wumi wa magono goha. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Ndi Chapanga mwene ndi mweatihengili aga goha kavili atipelili Mpungu Msopi, avya ulangisu wa kulangisa kuvya chakaka vindu vyoha Chapanga vyeativikili tete.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Tisindamili magono goha. Timanyili kuvya kutama muhiga iyi lukumbi lwoha ndi kutama patali na BAMBU. <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>Muni titama kwa sadika, lepi mukulola. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Nambu tisindamili na tiganili kuuleka wumi uwu wa higa na kuhamalila kwa BAMBU. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Nambu lijambu livaha neju ndi kumganisa BAMBU, tikavya na higa ya pamulima amala higa ya kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Muni tavoha yati tiyima palongolo ya chigoda cha uhamula cha Kilisitu, muni kila mundu apewayi chechiganikiwa kwa matendu gakitili lukumbi peavi pamulima, gabwina amala gahakau.<verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutepulaniswa na Chapanga mu njila ya Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Hinu, tete timanyili kumlumbalila BAMBU chindu kiki, ndi tisindimala kuvahuta vandu vangi. Chapanga atimanyili hotohoto, na nene nisadika kuvya mewa nyenye mtimanyili bwina neju. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Tete tikujilumbalila lepi tavete palongolo yinu, nambu tikuvapela fwasi ya kumekela tete muni muhotola kuvayangula vala vevimeka ndava ya kuloleka cha kuvala kuliku chevavili mugati ya mitima yavi. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Yikavya tiwonikini kuvya tipenga, ndi ndava ya kumganisa Chapanga, na yikavya tivili na luhala, ndava ya kuvatangatila nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Ndava tete tilongoswa na uganu wa Kilisitu ndi hinu timanyili kuvya mundu mmonga afwili ndava ya vandu voha, ndi kujova kuvya na tete tiwungini mulifwa laki. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>Afwili ndava ya vandu voha, muni voha vevitama muwumi, vakotoka kutama ndava ya kujiganisa vene, nambu kumganisa Chapanga mweafwili na kuyuka ndava yavi.<verse eid="2CO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Hinu, kuhumila hinu, nakumpima mundu yoyoha muluhala lwa chimundu. Hati ngati lukumbi lumonga tampimili Kilisitu muluhala lwa chimundu, hinu ndi lepi. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Mundu yoyoha akawungana na Kilisitu ivya mundu wa mupya, mambu ga kadeni gapitili, mambu ga mupya gahikili. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Loha ndi lihengu la Chapanga kutitepulanisa tete na mwene mu njila ya lifwa la Kilisitu, na kutipela lihengu la kuvatepulanisa vandu vangi na mwene. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Wenuwu ndi ujumbi witu, Chapanga autepulanisi vandu va mulima uwu na mwene mu njila ya lifwa la Kilisitu, changali kuvalanga kubuda kwavi. Chapanga atipelili tete lihengu la kuvatepulanisa vandu na mwene.<verse eid="2CO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Hinu tete tavajumbi wa Kilisitu, na Chapanga mwene ijova na tete kuvayupa neju nyenye. Tikuvayupa neju paliina la Kilisitu, mutepulaniswa na Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Kilisitu ambudili lepi Chapanga, nambu ndava yitu, Chapanga amkitili agega goha getimbudili, muni tete mukuwungana nayu, Chapanga atikita kuvya vabwina palongo yaki.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Hinu, tikavyai vana lihengu pamonga na Chapanga, tikuvayupa ubwina wa Chapanga wemupokili kuhuma kwaki wangali lihengu kwinu. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>Chapanga ijova mu Mayandiku Gamsopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">“Lukumbi lwelwaganikiwi nakuyuwanili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">ligono la usangula nakutangatili.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Yuwanila hinu ndi lukumbi lweluyadakiliwi, hinu ndi ligono la usangula!<verse eid="2CO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Tikotoka kuvya chipingilu kwa vandu vakoto kumsadika Kilisitu, muni lihengu litu likoto kuvya chindu lepi. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Pahala paki, tikujilangisa kuvya tete vanalihengu chakaka va Chapanga kwa kila chindu chetihenga, kwa kukangamala neju lukumbi lwa mang'ahiso na lukumbi lwelutopa na lipumba. <verse eid="2CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>Titoviwi, tivikiwi muchifungu, vatikiti chitututu pavandu, tihengili lihengu lelitopa neju, vatibesili kugona na pamahele titami changalya. <verse eid="2CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>Tikujilangisa kuvya vanalihengu va Chapanga kwa kuvya na mtima wa msopi na umanyi na kukangamala na ubwina witu. Tikumhuvalila Mpungu Msopi na kuvagana vandu Changali uhomela, <verse eid="2CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>tiukokwisi ujumbi wa chakaka kwa makakala ga Chapanga. Chitovanilu chitu ndi kujiyunga na kuhanganila ndi Kuhenga gegakumganisa Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>Tijiwusili na kuveveswa, kulaumiwa na kulumbiwa. Tivalangiwi ngati tikonga, kumbi tijova uchakaka. <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>Tilolekana ngati vangamanyikana kumbi timanyikana kwa voha, ngati vevafwili, nambu vawumi, titoviwi nambu tikomiwi lepi. <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>Tivii ngolongondi. Nambu magono goha tivii na luheku. Tilolekana vangangu nambu tikuvakita vandu vangi vavyai na vindu vyamahele, tilolekana tangali chindu nambu tivii na kila chindu.<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>Valongo Vakolinto, tilongili na nyenye muchakaka, na tikuvagana mumitima yitu yoha. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Tete nakupunguza kuvagana nyenye, nambu nyenye mupungwizi kutigana tete. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Hinu nijova na nyenye ngati vana vangu, ndi mtigana ngati chetivagana.<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkoto kuwungana na vandu vangammanya Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Mukoto kuwungana na vandu vangasadika. Wu, mambu gegakumganisa Chapanga na uhakau viyidakilana? Amala lumuli na chitita vihotola kutama pamonga? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Kilisitu ihotola wuli kuyidakilana na Setani? Musadika ihotola wuli kuhanganilana na mundu angasadika? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Nyumba ya Chapanga na chimong'omong'o viyidakilana wuli? Muni tavete ndi Nyumba ya Chapanga yeyivili wumi. Ngati Chapanga mwene ajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">“Kwavi yati nivika pandu pangu pakutama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">na kutama pagati yavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">Yati nivya na Chapanga wavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">na vene yati vivya vandu vangu.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/>Hinu BAMBU ijova mewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“Muwuka pagati yavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">mukajibagula nawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">mkoto kukamula chindu chechihakasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">na nene yati nikuvapokela.”<verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>Nene yati nivya na Dadi winu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">na nyenye yati mwivya vana vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">ijova BAMBU mweavi na makakala.<verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Hinu, valongo vangu, tikavya tipewili gala goha getalaganili, ndi tijinyambisa na chindu chochoha chechihotola kutihakasa higa na mipungu yitu, tivya vamsopi neju na kutama kumtopesa neju Chapanga.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luheku lwa Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Tiyupa mtipela fwasi mumitima yinu! Timuhokili lepi mundu yoyoha kumyoka amala kumkonga mundu yoyoha. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Nijova lepi lijambu lenili ndava ya kumuhamla mundu. Muni ngati cha nakalongolili kujova, nyenye muvi mumitima yitu, tifwai pamonga na kutama pamonga. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Nene nikuvasadika neju na kumeka panani yinu! Mumang'ahiso gitu goha, nipoliswi mtima na luheku neju.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Hati patahikili mulima wa Makedonia nakuhotola kupumulila. Tapatili mang'ahiso, kuhuma kila upandi, patavi na mhutanu na vandu vangi mewawa tavi na wogohi mumitima yitu. <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Nambu Chapanga, mwakuvapolesa mtima vangolongondi, avapolisi mtima mukubwela kwa Tito. <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>Lepi ndu mukubwela kwaki Tito, nambu ndava ya kujova pemwamkangamalisi mtima. Mwene atijovili chamwinogela kunilola na chamvii ngolongondi na chamwigana kunikengelela. Lijambu lenili litihekesa neju.<verse eid="2CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Hati ngati kwa balua yangu yila yavaletili ungolongondi, nambu hinu niviniswa lepi mtima. Ena naviniswi mtima panamanyili balua yila yivapeli ungolongondi pamonga yavi mulukumbi ndu. <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>Hinu nivii na luheku, lepi ndava mngolongoniswi, nambu ndava ngolongondi yinu yivakiti muleka matendu gahakau na kumuwuyila Chapanga. Mngolongoniswa ngati cheaganili Chapanga, ndava yeniyo tete tavavinisi lepi nyenye kwa loloha. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Kuvya na ungolongondi cheigana Chapanga kukuvahenga vandu vang'anamuka mumtima yavi na kunang'amuka kwenuko ndi kuleta usangula. Ndava yeniyo kawaka lijambu la kuvinisa mtima penapo, nambu ungolongondi wa vandu va pamulima wewileta lifwa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Hinu mlola chechihengiwi muungolongondi winu ngati Chapanga cheaganili, hinu nyenye yevakiti mkangamalayi neju, kulangisa kuvya mubudili lepi. Mwaviniswi mtima na kukenyemuka, chemvii na mnogo uvaha wa kunilola, na mukumlekela Chapanga ahukumwayi. Nyenye mulangisi mukila njila kuvya mubudili lepi mulijambu lenili.<verse eid="2CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Hinu, pamonga nayandiki balua yila yavili lepi ndava ya mundu mweabudili, amala ndava ya mundu mweabudiwi. Nayandiki muni yilolekana hotohoto palongolo ya Chapanga, nyenye chemujiwusili ndava yitu. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Ndava yeniyi tete tapoliswi mtima neju.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Lepi tapoliswi mtima ndu, ndi mewa Tito atisangalwisu kwa kusangalusa wa avili nawu muni nyenye chemwamsangalwisi mtima. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>Nene nivalumbalili neju palongolo yaki, na mu lijambu lenilo nakunikola soni. Tivajovili uchakaka magono goha, na kula kuvalumbalila nyenye palongolo ya Tito kuvi lijambu la chakaka. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>Hinu uganu waki wa mtima kwinu nyenye uyonjokesa neju akakumbukayi, ndi mwavoha nyenye chagayidakila malagizu gaki, na chamwampokili mumtima na utopesa neju. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Nina luheku neju kuvya nihotola kuvahuvalila nyenye mukila lijambu loloha.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwusa kwa mtima wa bwina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Valongo, tigana kuvapela malovi kuvala ubwina wa Chapanga, weavapelili misambi wa vandu vevamsadiki Kilisitu kumulima wa Makedonia. <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Vamsadika va kwenuko valingiwi neju kwa mang'ahiso, nambu sangalusa yavi yavili yivaha neju hati vawusili neju mumtima wa bwina kuwusa neju pamonga vavi vangangu neju. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Nihotola kujova uchakaka kuvya vawusili neju chavahotwili na hati kuliku chavahotwili, kavili ndi kwa ugana wavi vene. <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>Vatiyupili neju muni navene vavyai mulihengu la kuvatangatila vandu va Chapanga kumulima wa Yudea. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Lenilo lavili lijambu langahololewa! Kutumbula vajiwusili vene kwa BAMBU, kangi vajiwusili vene kwitu mewa, kulandana na uganu wa Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Ndava yeniyo tamyupili neju Tito mweatumbwili lihengu lenilo avatangatila mewa kutimalisa lihengu lenilo la kuwusa kwa mtima wa bwina. <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Nyenye muvi na kila chindu, sadika na muhotola kujova na umanya na ukangamala wa kukita gabwina na uganu winu kwitu. Hinu tilolela muvya na mtima wa bwina mukuwusa kwinu.<verse eid="2CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Nikuvapela lepi nyenye amuli, nambu nigana kulinga uganu winu wa chakaka mukuwanangisa na uganu wa vandu vangi. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Muni nyenye mmanyili ubwina wa BAMBU witu Yesu Kilisitu, pamonga na kuvya mwene avi na kila chindu, ajikitili mngangu ndava yinu, muni kuhuma muungangu waki, nyenye mvya na vindu vyamahele.<verse eid="2CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>Kuvala lijambu lenili, maholo gangu ndi aga, chabwina nyenye kukita gala gemwatumbwili mwaka wewapitili. Nyenye mwatumbwili kuwusa na kavili mwatumbwili kukita genago. <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>Hinu mumalakisa lihengu lenilo na ngati chamwanogela neju kutangatila. Na munogo wulawula wa kutangatila mewawa mumalakisa lihengu lenilo. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Muni yikavya mundu ana mtima wa kutangatila, Chapanga ipokela kila chindu chechiwusiwa na lepi chila angalikuvya nachu.<verse eid="2CO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Maholo gitu lepi kuvya vangi vayonjokeswa lukumbi vangi mung'aika, nambu yikuvagana mwavoha muwanangana. <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>Kila chamvii nachu hinu chiyonjokesu chivatangatila vala vevigana, muni navene pevivya na chiyonjokesu, vavatangatila nyenye mumaganu ginu, na mvya na uwananganu. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>Ngati Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova, “Mwayolili pamahele avili lepi na chiyonjokesu, na yula mwayolili padebe apungukiwi lepi.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tito na vayaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Nikumsengusa Chapanga mwavikili mugati ya mumtima wa Tito mnogo ngati mtima wenivii nawu nene wa kuvatangatila. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>Lepi kuvya ayidikili luyupu lwitu, muni avili na mnogo uvaha wa kutangatila, hati ahamwili mwene kubwela kwinu. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Pamonga na mwene tikumtuma mlongo mmonga mweitopeswa neju mumisambi yoha ya vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu, mulihengu laki la kukokosa Lilovi la Bwina. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Neju ya ago, mwene ahaguliwi na wa misambi ya vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu muni avyai muyitu mulugendu lwa kupeleka njombi zitu za uganu, lihengu letihenga ndava ya ukulu wa BAMBU kulangisa kuvya tigana kuvatangatila vandu.<verse eid="2CO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Tigana kuyepa lawama zezihotola kuhumalila ndava ya chetiyimalila njombi zenizi zamahele zeziwusiwa. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Malolelu gitu ndi kukita bwina, lepi palongola ya mihu ga BAMBU ndu, nambu mewawa palongolo ya vandu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Hinu pamonga na valongo venavo, timtumili mlongo yungi, ndi pamahele timlingili timulolili ana mnogo uvaha wa kutangatila, hati hinu ana mtima neju muni akuvasadika na nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Tito ndi myangu, tikita lihengu pamonga ndava yinu, nambu kuvala valongo vitu vangi vevibwela pamonga navo, venavo ndi vajumbi kuhuma misambi ya vandu vevakumsadika ndi vihenga lihengu ndava ya kuleta utopesa kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Hinu, muvalangisa usindimala wa uganu winu, misambi yoha ya vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu yeyavatumili vahotola kulola kuvya kumeka kwangu ndava yinu kwangabuda.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvatangatila vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Niganikiwa lepi kuvayandikila nyenye ndava ya kuvapelekela mtangatilu vandu va Chapanga va ku Yudea. <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>Nimanyili chamvii na mtima wa kutangatila, na namekili ndava yinu kulivala lijambu lila palongolo ya vandu va Makedonia. Navajovili, “Valongo vitu va ku Akaya vajitendekili kuhumila mwaka weupitili” Hinu mnogo winu umali kuvakita na vandu vangi vawusa. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Hinu, nivatumili valongo vitu avo, muni kujilumba kwitu kukoto kulolekana kuvya malovi gawaka, na ngati chanajovili nyenye mjitendekili neju kuwusa utangatila winu. <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Yikoto kuvya vandu va makedonia pevibwela pamonga na nene, tivakolela mwakona kujitendekela, penapo tete yati tikola soni ndava tivasadiki neju ndava yinu na nyenye mewa yati mwikola soni. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Hinu, yaniganili kuvayupa valongo ava vatilongolela kubwela kwinu vapata kuvika bwina njombi yinu yivaha yetalagini. Yeniyi yati yilangisa njombi iyi muwusili mukugana kwinu lepi kwa kulasimisa.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Mukumbuka, mwaimija padebe ibena padebe, mwaimija pavaha ibena pavaha. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Hinu, kila mmonga, awusa cheamwili, kwa mtima woha kwa ungolongondi amala kulasimishwa, muni Chapanga amganili yula mwaiwusa kwa sangalusa. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Chapanga ihotola kuvapela nyenye pamahele ya gala gemwigana mu mambu goha lukumbi lwoha mvya na kila chindu chemwigana ndi muhotola kutangatila mukila lihengu la bwina. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>Ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">“Mwene iwusa kwa ubwina, akuvapela vangangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">Ubwina waki uvya magono goha.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Na Chapanga mwakumpela mlimaji na mbeyu na chakulya, yati akuvapela mewa mbeyu zamwigana, na kuzikita zimela, zikula na kuvapela mabenu gamahele ndava ya kuwusa kwa mtima wa bwina. <verse eid="2CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Mwene yati akuvapela vindu vyamahele magono goha, muni vandu vamsengusa Chapanga ndava ya njombi zinu zevipokela kuhuma kwitu. <verse eid="2CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Ndava lihengu lenili la uwusaji lemwihenga lepi ndu, yikuvatangatila kuvapela vandu va Chapanga maganu gavi nambu yati yikuvakita vandu va mahele vamsengusa Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Ndava ya lihengu ilo la kuwusa kwinu vandu yati vakumulumba Chapanga mukulola uyidakila winu kwa Kilisitu mukujova, mewa ndava ya mtima winu wa bwina wa kuvapela vene mtangatila pamonga na vandu vangi. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>Hinu yati vakuvawombela nyenye mumtima wa uganu ndava ya mambu gavaha gemhengiwi na Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Timsengusa Chapanga ndava ya njombi yaki tete nakuhotola hati kujova!<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli akujikengelela ndava ya lihengu laki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Nene Pauli namwene mwanilolekana kuvya mpoli penivya pamonga na nyenye, nambu nilolekana na mkali panivya patali na nyenye, nikuvayupa neju kwa lipyana na ubwina waki Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Nikuvayupa mkoto kunikita nivya na mkali lukumbi lwe nibwela, muni nina uchakaka nihotola kuvya na mkali kwa voha vala veviholalela kuvya titama chimundu. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Chakaka titama pamulima, nambu nakukomana ngondo ngati vandu va pamulima chevitovana. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Muni, vindu vyatihengela kukomanela ngondo yitu lepi vya chimulima nambu makakala ga Chapanga gegigwisa ngomi za makoko zoha. Tihalabisa mambu goha ga udese, <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>na kubomola chindu chechimeka chechivikiwi ndava ya kubela umanya Chapanga, tikugakamula maholo goha na kugakita gamuyidikila Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Mukasindamala mukuyidakila, tete tijitendelekili kuhukumwa kila mundu yoyoha angayidakila.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Nyenye mlola mambu cha kuvala ndu. Wu, avi mundu yoyoha mwaiholalela kuvya mwene ndi mundu wa Kilisitu? Ena! Hinu mewawa atihololela tete kuvya vandu va Kilisitu ngati cheavili mwene. <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Hati ngati nimeka neju ndava ya uhotola wetipewili na BAMBU ndava ya kuvasindamalisa nyenye muusadika lepi kubomola, ndava ya lenilo nikola lepi soni. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Mbwitu muholalela kuvya nigana kuvayogopesa nyenye ndava ya mayandiku gangu. <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>Mundu ihotola kujova, “Balua za Pauli zikali na zigegii malovi gegitopa, nambu Pauli mwene peivya pamonga na tete ndi mundu mpoli na hati peilongela malovi gaki ndi ngati lepi chindu.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Mundu mwaijova chenicho mbanga akumbukayi hoti kuvya mambu goha giwanangana gala gatiyandika mubalua lukumbi pativya kutali, na gala getikita lukumbi pativya na nyenye.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Hinu ngatihotwi lepi kujivika amala kujiwanangisa vandu vala vevakujilumba vene. Vandu vevakujikita kuvya vene ndi chipimu cha kupimila vangi, vandu vevakujiwanangisa vene kwa vene, ndi vayimu. <verse eid="2CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Nambu tete yati timeka lepi neju, kumeka kwenuko yati kwivya kwa chipimu chila cha lihengu leatigotolili Chapanga, lihengu letiyendelela kuhenga mewa kwinu. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Kumeka kwitu tahumbili lepi mibaka yatavikiwi lukumbi lwatabwelili kwinu. Kuvaletela Lilovi la Bwina kumvala Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Hinu, timekela lepi lihengu levakitili vandu vangi, nambu tisadika kuvya sadika yinu iyonjokeseka kukula pagati yinu muchipimu cheativikili Chapanga. <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>Penapo yati tihotola kukokosa Lilovi la Bwina pamulima wungi, patali na nyenye, ndi timekela lihengu litu, lepi kumekela lihengu levakitili vandu vangi pandu pangi.<verse eid="2CO 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>Nambu ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi, “Mweimeka amekela gala geahengili BAMBU.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Mundu mweiyidakiliwa lepi yula mweakujilumbalila mwene, nambu mundu yula mwailumbiwa na BAMBU.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli na vamitumi vaudese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Mbanga ngamkangamili padebe, hati ngati nene namuyimu! Ena mkangamala padebe. <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Nene nikuvawonela wihu nambu wihu wa Chapanga, muni nyenye ndi ngati msikana kamwali mwetilagini kumgega ndava ya mgosi mmonga ndu Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Nambu niyogopa kuvya ngati liyoka lila mukuchenjela kwaki lamkongili Eva, akotoka kuvayoka maholo ginu, na kuleka kujiwusa kwinu muchakaka kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Muni mundu yoyoha mweibwela na kumkokosa Yesu mweavi chingi na yula mwetimkokosa, nikuvakangasa ndava nyenye mukumpokela kwa mawoko gavili, amala muyidikila mpungu amala lilovi la bwina lingi neju na lila lemwapokili kuhuma kwitu!<verse eid="2CO 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Kwali ngati nene namdebe kuliku venavo vevakujikemela vene “Vamitumi vakulu” <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Pangi nene nimanyili lepi kujova bwina. Nambu umanya nivii nawu, lijambu lenili tililangisi hotohoto kwinu, kila pandu na kila lukumbi.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Nene nakokwisi kwinu Lilovi la Bwina ga Chapanga changali kugana luhuna, najihelisi ndava ya kuvakwiha nyenye. Wu, nakitili uhakau? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Panahengili lihengu pagati yinu maganu gangu napewili utangatila kuhuma mumisambi yingi ya vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu. Nihotola kujova kuvya navanyagili vindu vyavi muni nihotola kuvahengele lihengu nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>Panakavili na nyenye namng'aili lepi mundu yeyoha panaganili maganu, valongo vevahumili Makedonia vaniletili kila chindu chenaganili. Natumili luhala neju nikotoka kumng'aha mundu yeyoha yula muni nipata vindu venigana mu njila yoyoha yila, ndi yati niyendelela kukita mewa. <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>Ngati chakaka yila ya Kilisitu cheyivili mugati yangu, kawaka mundu yoyoha mweihotola kunibesa kumekela lijambu lenilo popoha pamulima wa Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Ndava kyani nijova chenicho? Ndava muni nivaganili lepi nyenye? Chapanga amanyili kuvya nivaganili!<verse eid="2CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>Yati niyendelela kukita ngati chanikita hinu, muni nikotoka kuvapela fwasi vala vevakujikemela vamitumi vakulu, vevilonda fwasi ya kumekela kuvya vikita lihengu ngati tete. <verse eid="2CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Muni, venavo ndi vamitumi vaudese, vikita lihengu la udese vevajikita ngati vamitumi va chakaka va Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Lijambu la kukangasa lepi, muni hati Setani mwene akujikita kuvya mtumu wa kunani wa lumuli! <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Hinu ndi lijambu lepi la kukangasa kuvya na vanalihengu va Setani navene vakujikita kuvya vanalihengu va mambu gabwina palongolo ya Chapanga. Mwishu wavi yati vipata uhamula kulandana na matendu gavi.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ing'ahika ndava ya utumi waki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Nijova kavili. Mundu akotoka kuniholalela kuvya namyimu, nambu ngati muhomela chenicho, hinu muniyidakila ngati namyimu, muni na nene nivya chindu chakujimekela padebe. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Chanijova hinu lepi chila chalagizi BAMBU, kuvala lijambu lenili la kumekela, nijova ndu kujova mundu muyimu. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Ndava muni vamahele vimeka ngati vandu va pamulima chevimeka, na nene mewa yati nimeka. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Nyenye ndi muhololela muvi na luhala, ndi mana mukuvasindimalila hati vayimu! <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Mukumsindimalisa hati mundu mweakuvakita nyenye vavanda, mundu mweakuvanyaga vindu vinu, mweakuvahindalila, mweakuvavevesa na kuvatova kumihu! <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Nikola soni kujova, tavi lepi na makakala ga kuhenga aga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Nambu ngati avi mundu yoyoha mweihotola kumeka, nijova ngati mundu namyimu, mewawa nene nijova chakaka yati nimeka. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Vandu vala va ku Ebulania? Na nene mewa. Wu, vene ndi Vaisilaeli? Na nene mewa. Wu, vene ndi vachiveleku va Ibulahimu? Na nene mewa. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Vene ndi vanalihengu va Kilisitu? Na nene mewa, nijova ago chilupengu. Nene ndi muhengaji neju wa Kilisitu kuliku vene. Nene nihengi lihengu lelinonopa neju, nitamili muchifungu pamahele, nitoviwi pamahele neju na navili papipi kufwa pamahele. <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Mala mhanu natoviwi na ndomondo alobaini yipungula yimonga na Vayawudi. <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>Natoviwi na mchapilu mala zidatu, natoviwi maganga mala yimonga. Mala yidatu nadenyikiwi na watu munyanja, na mwenumo nagonili lepi mbaka lukela na kuwela muhi woha. <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Pamahele mulugendu lwangu, nisumwiki mumifuleni kumema manji, kuhuma muvanyagaji vakolonjinji vayangu, kuhuma kwa vandu vangali Vayawudi. Na kuhuma kumujini, kulugangatu na munyanja na kuhuma kwa valongo vaudese. <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>Nikitili lihengu na kung'ahika, nigonili lepi pamahele ndava ya lihengu, kuni nivii na njala na njota. Pamahele nitamii na njala na kutama changali nyula za kunigubika pambepu. <verse eid="2CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Pamonga na gangi gamahele, mewa kila ligono niholela misambi ya vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu voha. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Ngati mundu yoyoha atotokili mewawa na nene nitotokili na mundu yoyoha akalongoswa mukubuda, mewa nene niviniswa mtima.<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Yikaniganayi kumeka, ndi yati nimekela kutotokela kwangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Chapanga Dadi wa BAMBU Yesu, liina laki lilumbiwa magono goha. Mwene amanyili kuvya nijova lepi udese. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Panakavi ku Damasko, mkulu wa muji, mwavili pahi ya nkosi Aleta, avikii ulonda pamuji wa Damasko muni anikamula. <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>Nambu vakanivika mulidengu livaha, na kunihelesa kuvala kupitila fwasi yeyavi muluwumba lwa muji, naholwiti mumawoko gaki.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Njozi na magubukulo ga Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Yati nijilumba hati ngati chabwina lepi! Nambu hinu yati nijova ndava ya njozi na ugubukulo weanipelili BAMBU. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Nimmanyili mundu mmonga mweamsadiki Kilisitu, ndi miyaka kumi na mcheche yeyipitili atoliwi mbaka kunani neju kwa Chapanga. Kwali ngati avi kwenuko muhiga amala mumpungu, Chapanga ndi amanyili. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3"/>Niwuyila kujova, nimanyili kuvya mundu mwenuyo atoliwi mbaka kunani. Nambu kwali ngati avili kwenuko kwa higa amala kwa mpungu, Chapanga ndi amanyili. <verse eid="2CO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4"/>Kwenuko ayuwini mambu gamfiyu ndi hati mundu nakuganikiwa kugajova. <verse eid="2CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Hinu, yati nimekela ndava ya mundu wa namuna yeniyo, lepi ndava ya nene namwene, ndi ndava ya kutotokela kwangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Kuvya nigana kumeka nganivili lepi namuyimu hati padebe, muni nganijova uchakaka ndu. Nambu nimeka lepi, mbwitu mundu aniholalela neju ya chila cheakuchiwona nihenga neju wumi wangu.<verse eid="2CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Nambu, ndava ya mambu aga gakulu genigubukuliwi gakotoka kunigalisa umeka, nasopiwi mvinisu muhiga ngati kuhomwa na minga, mweavi ngati mjumbi wa Setani mweakuning'aha, muni nikotoka kumeka neju. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Namuyupili neju BAMBU mala datu muni chindu chenicho cheniwuka. <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>Nambu anijovili, “Ubwina wangu wikukola, muni uhotola wangu witimaliswa neju mukutotokela kwangu ndava yeniyo yati nimeka neju kwa luheku.” Muni nimemeswa na uhotola wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Hinu niyidikila kuvya nitotokili, kuuveveswa na maligu na kutyalatyala na mang'ahiso ndava ya kuhengela Kilisitu, muni penitotokela ndi penivya na makakala.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli akuvahololela Vakolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Nivii ngati namyimu, nambu nyenye munilasimisha kuvya chenicho. Nyenye ndi mwaganikiwi kunilumba. Muni, hati ngati nene chindu lepi, nambu nene mdebe lepi kuliku avo vevakujikemela vene “Vamitumi vakulu” <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Chinamtiti na makangaso gakunilangisa nene kuvya ndi mtumi, gahengiki pagati yinu kwa kukangamala woha. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Wu, chindu kiki navahengili lepi nyenye chenivahengili misambi yingi ya vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vangi, pangi ndava muni nene nivang'ahili lepi kupata utangatila winu? Chondi munilekekesa mukuvabudila kwenuko.<verse eid="2CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Hinu nijitendekili kubwela mala ya datu kwinu, na yati nikuvang'aha lepi. Muni chanilonda lepi vindu vinu nambu mwavene nyenye. Hinu tiyovalili kulola dadi na nyina vakuvavikila vindu vana vavi, nambu tiyovalili lepi kulola vana vakuvavikila vindu dadi na nyina wavi. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Nene nijitendekili kutumila kila chindu chenivili nachu, hati kujiwusa namwene, kwa kuvatangatila nyenye. Wu, yati mukunigana padebe ndava muni nene nivaganili nyenye neju?<verse eid="2CO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Hinu yati mwiyidikila kuvya navi lepi ndwika kwinu. Nambu pangi mundu yungi yati ijova, “Ndava muni Pauli achenjili avakongili.” <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Wu, nene navatolili vindu vinu mu njila ya mjumbi yoyoha mwena mtumili kwinu? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Nene namyupili neju Tito, namtumili kwinu na mlongo witu yungi. Wu, Tito atolili vindu vinu? Wu, mmanyili lepi kuvya tete maholo gitu na lugendu lwitu ndi lumonga?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Pangi muholalela kuvya mbaka hinu tikujikengela tavete palongolo yinu! Nambu, tijova mambu aga palongolo ya Chapanga kuni tiwungini na Kilisitu. Mambu aga goha, vaganu vangu ndi ndava ya kuvatangatila nyenye. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Niyogopa, pangi panibwela kwinu yati nikuvakolela ngati chenigana nene, na nyenye munilola ngati chemwigana nyenye nivyai, Niyogopa pangi kwivya na ngondo, wihu, kujovana, mhutanu kumeka, kuheha na chitututu. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Niyogopa pangi lugendu lwenibwela kavili. Chapanga wangu yati akunikita nikola soni palongolo yinu, na nene yati nivavembela ndava ya vamahele va vala vevambudili Chapanga, nambu vamuwuyili lepi Chapanga ndava ya uhakau wavi, ugoni na mnogo uhakau wevakitili.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli imakisila mumalagizu kwa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Hinu ndi mala yangu ya datu yenikuvagendelela kwinu. Ngati chegijova Mayandiku Gamsopi “Kila lijambu yati lihamuliwa muvandu vevagawene vavili amala vamahele.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Namali kuvajovela, ngati chayavili lugendu lwangu lwa pili, hinu nijova kavili kuni nivii kutali, vala voha vevakitili uhakau veviyendelela kuhenga uhakau pamonga vangi vala, penibwela nikuvahengela lepi lipyana. <verse eid="2CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>Mukujilolela mwavene uchakaka wemwigana kuvya Kilisitu ijova na nyenye mu njila yangu. Kwinu Kilisitu atotokili lepi, nambu yati ilangisa makakala gaki pagati yinu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Hati ngati akomiwi na kuvambiwa pamsalaba ndava ya kutotokela, nambu hinu itama muuhotola wa Chapanga. Tete mewa titotokili mukuwungana nayu nambu yati tivya na wumi pamonga nayu muni tihotola kuhenga lihengu pagati yinu.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Mujilingulila bwina mwavene muni mumanya ngati chakaka musindamili musadika, mjilola mwavene. Wu nakujimanya ngati Yesu Kilisitu avili mugati yinu? Ngati lepi ndi nyenye mshindwili. <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Nambu nisadika kuvya nyenye mwimanya kuvya tete tashindwili lepi. <verse eid="2CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Tikumuyupa Chapanga mkoto kukita uhakau wowoha, nambu lepi ndava muni tilolekanayi na vandu kuvya ngati tavandu vetihotwili, ndi muni mkita gabwina, hati ngati tete tiwonikini kuvya tishindwili. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Muni nakuhotola kuubela uchakaka, uhotola wetivili nawu ndi wa kuyendeleza uchakaka. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Tiheka muni tete lukumbi petatotokili, nambu nyenye muvi na makakala, ndava yeniyo tikuvayupa mkoto kupungula chochoha. <verse eid="2CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Hinu, niyandika balua iyi kuni nivii kutali, muni nikahika kwinu nikotoka kuganikiwa kuvya mkali kwinu, mu kuhengela uhotola wenipelili BAMBU, ndi uhotola wa kuvasindimalisa sadika yinu nambu lepi uhotola wa kuvagwisa.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Hinu, valongo hinu nikuvalaga! Mkoto kupungukiwa na chindu na mukamula malagizu gangu, muvya na liholo limonga, mtama kwa uteke. Nikumuyupa Chapanga mweileta uganu na uteke avyai pamonga na nyenye.<verse eid="2CO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Mjambusana mukulangisa uganu.<verse eid="2CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Vandu voha va Chapanga kwitu vakuvajambusa. <verse eid="2CO 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14"/>Ubwina wa BAMBU Yesu Kilisitu na uganu wa Chapanga na umonga wa Mpungu Msopi, uvyai pamonga na mwavoha nyenye.<verse eid="2CO 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
